WEBVTT

00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:06.883
Here is a file with two events, using those columns:

00:00:06.883 --> 00:00:11.645
the title, the alias and path, the location, the number of seats, the

00:00:11.645 --> 00:00:16.661
dates and times, whether the event is featured, the speakers, and a link.

00:00:17.111 --> 00:00:19.573
Choose the file and click Upload.

00:00:19.573 --> 00:00:25.441
The import runs in the background, and the Import and Export page follows its progress.

00:00:28.035 --> 00:00:32.605
When it has finished, the events are content items like any other, with

00:00:32.605 --> 00:00:35.215
every field filled in from its column.

